# Deploy Edge Functions

Whenever you create or edit anything under `supabase/functions/` (including `_shared/`), deploy the affected function(s) before finishing the task. Do not leave deploy as a follow-up for the user.

## How

From the repo root:

```bash
npx supabase functions deploy <function-name> --no-verify-jwt
```

- Deploy every function whose code or shared imports you changed (e.g. `generate-replies`).
- If `_shared/` changed, redeploy all functions that import those shared modules.
- If deploy needs approval or network permissions, request them and complete the deploy in the same turn.
- Confirm success in your reply (function name + that it deployed). Do not only say “remember to deploy.”
